// Ammunition-enchantment buff (touch your own arrows/bolts, sheet range: Touch, first-person
// "you imbue a bundle of arrows" -- no third-party creature named, so no touch-ally deviation).
// "Each enchanted projectile that strikes a foe sears it with an extra burst of flame" maps
// directly onto the existing Flame buff (attacks cause the burning debuff on the target) --
// an exact fit, not a substitution.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Flame, data: BuffData(strength: 0.2, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 60.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Arcane), cooldown: Some(30.0)),
)
